<title>USA: Casino Resource bids $14.25 mln for casino.</title>
<headline>Casino Resource bids $14.25 mln for casino.</headline>
<dateline>BILOXI, Miss. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino Resource Corp said Monday it and its joint venture partners, Robert and Lowana Low, have submitted a contract to buy the Palace Casino in Biloxi, Mississippi.</p>
<p>The proposed deal is for $14.25 million, consisting of $11.5 million in cash and the balance in notes, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it and the Lows have formed a Mississippi limited liability company, New Palace Inc, to buy and operate the casino and its assets.</p>
</text>
